- @spain_relations
- @post_event: We don't want to do anything in this ministry at the moment
- @easy_discard

@spain_relations
title: Can we mend our current relations with the Spanish government?
subtitle: \[-1 budget\]
choose-if: not art155_ever and government_budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if art155_ever: With Article 155 in force, there's no way for this to happen. ?][? if government_budget < 1: Not enough budget. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.government_budget -= 1;
    switch (Q.spain_pm_party) {
        case "pp":
            Q.cat_spa_relations += 5;
            break;
        case "psoe":
            Q.cat_spa_relations += 8;
            break;
        case "vox":
        case "cs":
            Q.cat_spa_relations += 2;
            break;
        case "podemos":
        case "iu":
        case "up":
            Q.cat_spa_relations += 12;
            break;
    }
!}

We've done our best to mend relations with the current [+ spanish_coalition_disp +] in Moncloa.
